1. C. Huygens, letter to the Royal Society, February 1665: the sympathy of clocks. See M. Bennett et al., "Huygens's
   clocks", *Proceedings of the Royal Society A* 458, 563–579 (2002).
2. A. P. French, *Vibrations and Waves*, Norton (1971), chapter 5.
3. G. Herzberg, *Molecular Spectra and Molecular Structure II: Infrared and Raman Spectra of Polyatomic Molecules*,
   Van Nostrand (1945): the CO₂ frequencies.
